        {
          "es": "Al final del episodio anterior, Loki guardaba un secreto. Lejos de Asgard, en Jotunheim, tenía otra familia.",
          "en": "At the end of the last episode, Loki was keeping a secret. Far from Asgard, in Jotunheim, he had another family."
        },
        {
          "es": "Allí vivía la giganta Angrboda, y con ella Loki tuvo tres hijos.",
          "en": "There lived the giantess Angrboda, and with her Loki had three children."
        },
        {
          "es": "El primero era un lobo, Fenrir. El segundo, una serpiente, Jormungandr.",
          "en": "The first was a wolf, Fenrir. The second was a serpent, Jormungandr."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y la tercera era una niña llamada Hel, mitad viva y mitad muerta.",
          "en": "And the third was a girl named Hel, half alive and half dead."
        }
