          "en": "Hel he cast into Niflheim, the world of mist and ice, and gave her power over nine worlds."
        },
        {
          "es": "Allí gobierna a los muertos que no mueren en batalla: los que mueren de enfermedad o de vejez.",
          "en": "There she rules the dead who do not die in battle: those who die of sickness or old age."
        },
        {
          "es": "Tiene grandes salas, y su rostro es la mitad de una persona viva y la otra mitad, de un muerto.",
          "en": "She has great halls, and her face is half that of the living and half that of the dead."
