      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Al lobo Fenrir lo criaron los dioses en Asgard, y nadie se atrevía a acercarse a su boca.",
          "en": "The wolf Fenrir was raised by the gods in Asgard, and no one dared to come near his jaws."
        },
        {
          "es": "Solo Tyr, el más valiente de los dioses, se animaba a ir y darle de comer.",
          "en": "Only Tyr, the bravest of the gods, had the courage to go and feed him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero cada día el lobo crecía, y las profecías decían que sería la perdición de los dioses.",
          "en": "But every day the wolf grew, and the prophecies said he would be the doom of the gods."
        }
