      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Los dioses ataron la cinta a una enorme roca y la hundieron en lo más profundo de la tierra.",
          "en": "The gods fastened the ribbon to an enormous rock and sank it deep into the earth."
        },
        {
          "es": "Fenrir abrió las fauces para morder, y le clavaron una espada entre las mandíbulas, con la punta hacia arriba.",
          "en": "Fenrir opened his jaws to bite, and they thrust a sword between them, its point pointing up."
        },
        {
          "es": "Allí aullará hasta Ragnarök, el fin del mundo. Y por eso de su boca corre un río de baba: el Ván.",
          "en": "There he will howl until Ragnarök, the end of the world. And that is why a river of spittle runs from his mouth: the Ván."
        }
