          "en": "So Loki's children were set apart: the serpent in the sea, Hel among the dead, and the wolf bound on his island."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero ninguno desapareció. Los tres esperan, y cada uno tiene su lugar en el final del mundo.",
          "en": "But none of them vanished. All three wait, and each has a place in the end of the world."
        },
        {
          "es": "Mientras tanto, Thor emprende su viaje al país de los gigantes. Esa es la historia del próximo episodio: Thor entre los gigantes.",
          "en": "Meanwhile, Thor sets out for the land of the giants. That is the story of the next episode: Thor Among the Giants."
        }
